div.p:
Considering that these claims have been presented to the United States Shipping
                    Board Emergency Fleet Corporation and that the said corporation and the
                    claimants have failed to reach an agreement for the settlement thereof;

The Arbitral Tribunal shall be constituted in accordance with Article 87 (Chapter
                    IV) and Article 59 (Chapter III) of the said Convention of October 18, 1907,
                    except as hereinafter provided, to wit:
